  "summary": "A remote HTTP server can set a cookie that curl accepts and writes to a",
  "details": "A remote HTTP server can set a cookie that curl accepts and writes to a\nNetscape cookie jar but cannot reload. On the next invocation using the same\npath for `--cookie` and `--cookie-jar`, curl fails before connecting, then the\ncleanup procedure replaces the jar with an empty file, deleting cookies for\nunrelated domains.",
